The source is "abcde", while the words is a list of "a", "bb", "acd", and "ace".
The lastsource is 4, while the count is 0.
For each word in words.
The lastword is the last position of word.
The cursor is 0.
For every spot from 0 to lastsource.
If cursor is at most lastword and character spot of source is character cursor of word, add 1 to cursor.
If spot is lastsource and cursor is more than lastword, add 1 to count.

Show count.
